SUMMARY:Recovery + Easy Zone 2
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3400 kcal\, 165 g protein\, 485 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 30-60 g carbs 60-120 min before running\, then 25-
 35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: easy_run\nRun volume: 5 km\nAdj
 ustments:\n- Adjusted for schedule constraints.\n- Adjusted for temporary
  low-back recovery constraint.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-10 min easy movement\, jo
 int prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets before loading.\n\nMain Work:\n- Eas
 y run RPE 3-4: 5 km at conversational effort\; cadence light and relaxed.
 \n\nOptional:\n- 20-30 min walk later if knees feel normal.\n\nRun:\n- Pl
 anned running volume: 5 km.\n\nFueling:\n- fruit or rye bread plus caffei
 ne is enough before a short morning run.\n\nRecovery:\n- 8-10 min hips\, 
 quads\, calves\, and ankles.
