 l ramp sets before loading.\n\nMain Work:\n- Bike aerobic RPE 3-4: 25-40 
 min conversational\; keep cadence smooth and pressure through the whole f
 oot.\n- Foot prep: foot-intrinsic activation\, short-foot / arch lifts\, 
 isometric inversion and eversion\, sole-to-sole isometrics\, and banded e
 version or inversion within 0-2/10 symptoms.\n\nOptional:\n- Optional wal
