SUMMARY:Core + Chest/Back Strength Capacity
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3350 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 455 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 35-45 g protein in 4 meals\, 40-70 g carbs before 
 lifting\, and a protein-plus-carb meal after training.\nCategory: gym\nRu
 n volume: 0 km\nAdjustments:\n- Back-friendly loading ramp.\n- Return-to-
 impact loading ramp.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5 min easy bike\, shoulder prep\, tho
 racic mobility\, hip openers\, and two light press/row ramp sets.\n\nMain
  Work:\n- Progression: this is the eighth strength day in the 14-day wave
 \; cap work at RPE 7-8\, use supersets\, and trim accessories before anch
 or work if recovery dips. Low-back ramp: start lightly and add load only 
 when the next morning is symptom-free. Return-to-impact ramp: progress on
 ly when symptoms stay 0-2/10 and the next morning is not worse.\n- Chest 
 volume: bench press 3 x 6-8\, incline dumbbell press 3 x 8-10\, dumbbell 
 press 2 x 8-10\, pec-deck 2 x 12-15\, dips 2 x 6-10\, and push-ups 2 x cl
 ean reps.\n- Back volume: lat pulldown or pull-ups 3 x 8-12\, cable row o
 r chest-supported row 3 x 8-12\, face pulls 2 x 12-15\, and rear delt fly
  or reverse pec-deck 2 x 15-20.\n- Leg maintenance: hip thrust or glute b
 ridge 3 x 8-12\, leg extension 2 x 12-15\, and seated or lying hamstring 
 curl 2 x 10-15 at RPE 7.\n- Core volume: Pallof press 3 x 10 per side\, s
 ide plank 2 x 30 sec per side\, plank variations 2 x 30-45 sec\, hanging 
 leg raises 2-3 sets\, weighted sit-ups 2 x 8-12\, and kettlebell side ben
 d or around the head kettlebell 2 x 10. Arm top-up: tricep pulldown 2 x 1
 0-15\, preacher curls 2 x 10-15\, and reverse curls 2 x 12-15. Low-back r
 amp: skip loaded hinges and back-extension work\; start lightly and keep 
 supported posterior-chain work pain-free.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros
 \, keep protein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and after tr
 aining.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if 
 joints feel stiff.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
