 ly when symptoms stay 0-2/10 and the next morning is not worse.\n- Pull-u
 ps: 5 x 4-8 or 20-30 total quality reps at RPE 8.\n- Dips or push-ups: 3 
 x 8-15 at RPE 8-9 paired with one-arm dumbbell row or cable row 3 x 8-12 
 at RPE 8.\n- Shoulder and chest block: incline dumbbell press 2-3 x 8-12 
 at RPE 8 plus pec-deck 2 x 10-15\, lateral raises 3 x 15-20\, and rear de
 lt fly 2 x 15-20.\n- Arm and core finisher: tricep pulldown 2 x 10-15 plu
 s hanging leg raises 2-3 sets at RPE 8. Low-back ramp: skip loaded hinges
