  8 each way\, and weighted sit-ups 2 x 8-12. Low-back ramp: skip loaded h
 inges and back-extension work\; start lightly and keep supported posterio
 r-chain work pain-free.\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep protein ne
